---
---
<section id="pricing" class="modelos-section">

  <div class="mod-flow-bg" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg class="mod-flow-svg" viewBox="0 0 1200 340" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <ellipse cx="200"  cy="200" rx="240" ry="110" fill="rgba(1,125,212,0.04)"/>
      <ellipse cx="700"  cy="160" rx="280" ry="100" fill="rgba(1,125,212,0.03)"/>
      <ellipse cx="1100" cy="180" rx="200" ry="90"  fill="rgba(72,167,242,0.025)"/>

      <path class="mf mf-1"   d="M-100,280 C180,220 480,120 720,160 C920,190 1080,80 1300,30"/>
      <path class="mf mf-2"   d="M-100,310 C140,248 420,162 660,188 C870,210 1060,118 1300,62"/>
      <path class="mf mf-3"   d="M-100,250 C220,188 540,80 780,130 C970,168 1100,52 1300,0"/>
      <path class="mf mf-acc" d="M-100,268 C200,204 520,98 760,148 C952,178 1090,66 1300,16"/>

      <circle class="mf-dot mfd-1" cx="210"  cy="254" r="3"   fill="#48a7f2"/>
      <circle class="mf-dot mfd-2" cx="560"  cy="158" r="2.5" fill="#017dd4"/>
      <circle class="mf-dot mfd-3" cx="880"  cy="168" r="3"   fill="#48a7f2"/>
      <circle class="mf-dot mfd-4" cx="1140" cy="72"  r="2"   fill="#017dd4"/>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <div class="mod-content">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-badge">MODELOS DE TRABAJO</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Modelos de colaboración flexibles y predecibles.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="modelos-grid">
      <article class="modelo-card">
        <div class="modelo-header">
          <span class="modelo-tipo">Proyecto</span>
          <h3 class="modelo-titulo">Desarrollo de Proyectos</h3>
          <p class="modelo-enfoque">Sitios Web y Consultoría Técnica</p>
        </div>
        <p class="modelo-desc">Presupuesto cerrado basado en el alcance del proyecto. Ideal para el lanzamiento de webs corporativas, rediseños y auditorías de arquitectura técnica.</p>
        <div class="modelo-billing">
          <span class="billing-label">Facturación</span>
          <span class="billing-val">50% inicio / 50% entrega</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="modelo-features">
          <li>Hitos definidos y plazos cerrados</li>
          <li>Sin costes ocultos ni sobrefacturación</li>
          <li>Entregables validados en cada fase</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#contacto" class="btn btn-secondary modelo-cta">Iniciar un Proyecto</a>
      </article>

      <article class="modelo-card modelo-featured">
        <div class="modelo-header">
          <span class="modelo-tipo featured-tipo">MRR</span>
          <h3 class="modelo-titulo">Suscripción de Desarrollo</h3>
          <p class="modelo-enfoque">SaaS y Soporte Operativo Continuo</p>
        </div>
        <p class="modelo-desc">Capacidad de ingeniería constante para evolucionar tu SaaS, escalar tu infraestructura crítica y mantener tu operación activa con previsibilidad financiera total.</p>
        <div class="modelo-billing">
          <span class="billing-label">Facturación</span>
          <span class="billing-val">Suscripción mensual fija sin sorpresas</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="modelo-features">
          <li>Acceso directo al equipo que construye tu proyecto</li>
          <li>SLAs claros y auditables</li>
          <li>Escala con tu operación</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#contacto" class="btn btn-light-on-dark modelo-cta">Explorar Suscripción</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .modelos-section {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: var(--space-xl) 0;
    background-color: var(--color-muted-light);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(44, 34, 30, 0.05);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(44, 34, 30, 0.05);
  }

  .section-badge {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .modelos-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    max-width: 960px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .modelo-card {
    background-color: var(--color-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-muted);
    border-radius: var(--border-radius);
    padding: 3rem 2.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    box-shadow: var(--box-shadow);
    transition: var(--transition);
  }

  .modelo-card:hover {
    box-shadow: var(--box-shadow-hover);
    transform: translateY(-4px);
  }

  .modelo-card.modelo-featured {
    background-color: var(--color-text);
    border-color: var(--color-text);
    color: var(--color-bg);
  }

  .modelo-header {
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  .modelo-tipo {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
  }

  .featured-tipo {
    color: var(--color-accent-light);
  }

  .modelo-titulo {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .modelo-featured .modelo-titulo {
    color: var(--color-bg);
  }

  .modelo-enfoque {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .modelo-featured .modelo-enfoque {
    color: rgba(250, 246, 240, 0.6);
  }

  .modelo-desc {
    font-size: 0.97rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    flex-grow: 1;
  }

  .modelo-featured .modelo-desc {
    color: rgba(250, 246, 240, 0.72);
  }

  .modelo-billing {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-muted-light);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-muted-light);
    padding: 1.25rem 0;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  .modelo-featured .modelo-billing {
    border-color: rgba(250, 246, 240, 0.15);
  }

  .billing-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }

  .modelo-featured .billing-label {
    color: rgba(250, 246, 240, 0.5);
  }

  .billing-val {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .modelo-featured .billing-val {
    color: var(--color-accent-light);
  }

  .modelo-features {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .modelo-features li {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .modelo-features li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .modelo-featured .modelo-features li {
    color: rgba(250, 246, 240, 0.72);
  }

  .modelo-featured .modelo-features li::before {
    background-color: var(--color-accent-light);
  }

  .modelo-cta {
    align-self: flex-start;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .btn-light-on-dark {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 1rem 2rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    border-radius: var(--border-radius);
    border: 1px solid rgba(250, 246, 240, 0.35);
    background-color: transparent;
    color: var(--color-bg);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: var(--transition);
  }

  .btn-light-on-dark:hover {
    background-color: rgba(250, 246, 240, 0.1);
    border-color: var(--color-bg);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .modelos-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  .mod-flow-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .mod-flow-svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; }

  .mod-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .mf {
    fill: none;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
    stroke-dasharray: 1850;
    stroke-dashoffset: 1850;
  }
  .mf-1   { stroke: #017dd4; stroke-width: 2;   filter: drop-shadow(0 0 7px rgba(1,125,212,0.55)); }
  .mf-2   { stroke: #017dd4; stroke-width: 1.5; opacity: 0.32; }
  .mf-3   { stroke: #48a7f2; stroke-width: 1;   opacity: 0.20; }
  .mf-acc { stroke: #48a7f2; stroke-width: 1.5; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px rgba(72,167,242,0.65)); }

  @keyframes mfDraw {
    0%   { stroke-dashoffset: 1850; opacity: 0; }
    6%   { opacity: 0.85; }
    88%  { opacity: 0.65; }
    100% { stroke-dashoffset: 0; opacity: 0; }
  }
  .mf-dot { opacity: 0; filter: drop-shadow(0 0 4px #48a7f2); }
  @keyframes mfDot {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 0; }
    50%       { opacity: 0.85; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .mf-1   { animation: mfDraw 7.5s ease-in-out 0s    infinite; }
    .mf-2   { animation: mfDraw 7.5s ease-in-out 1.1s  infinite; }
    .mf-3   { animation: mfDraw 7.5s ease-in-out 2s    infinite; }
    .mf-acc { animation: mfDraw 7.5s ease-in-out 0.55s infinite; }
    .mfd-1  { animation: mfDot  2.8s ease-in-out 2.2s  infinite; }
    .mfd-2  { animation: mfDot  2.8s ease-in-out 3.1s  infinite; }
    .mfd-3  { animation: mfDot  2.8s ease-in-out 4s    infinite; }
    .mfd-4  { animation: mfDot  2.8s ease-in-out 4.9s  infinite; }
  }
</style>
